---
title: Schedule in progress
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Worker
    participant MES as MES/Simulation
    box Adaptive Scheduler
        participant App
        participant Core
    end
    participant Nest as Nesting
    Worker ->> MES: finishes task
    MES ->> App: send finished task
    activate App
    alt task finished on time
        App -->> MES: nothing to change
        MES -->> Worker: None
    else task finished not on time
        App ->> App: reschedule via right/left shift
        App ->> App: evaluate schedule
        alt signifcantly changed schedule
            App ->>+ Core: send planning horizon, graphs <br/> and current schedule
            Core ->> Core: reschedule
            Core ->>- App: propose feasible schedule
            App ->> App: Validate and evaluate schedule
            alt new batches
                App ->>+ Nest: propose order and batches
                Nest -->>- App: propose batches
                alt different batches
                    App ->>+ Core: send proposed batches
                    Core ->> Core: resolve graphs
                    Core -->>- App: propose feasible schedule
                    App ->> App: validate schedule and resolve ids   
                    App ->> App: evaluate schedule   
                end
            end
        end
        App -->> MES: return schedule
        MES -->> Worker: Notify changes
        deactivate App
    end